# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte, and frozen since its recorder went with the C# core host on 2026-11-07 - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command search
usage 1   search <space> <val> [<w>] [flags]  start a new search: find every address equal to <val>
usage 2                                 (flags: -w 1|2|4, --signed|--unsigned|--float, --le|--be, --dec|--hex, --aligned|--unaligned, --json)
usage 3   search unknown <space> [flags]  capture full RAM baseline without filtering
usage 4   search eq|ne|gt|lt <space> <val> [flags] | search between <space> <lo> <hi> [flags]
usage 5   search refine|eq|ne|gt|lt <val> | search between <lo> <hi>
usage 6   search changed|unchanged|increased|decreased | search incby|decby <n>
usage 7   search pointer <space> <target> [--max-offset N] | search pointer rescan <target>
usage 8   search undo | search list [<count>] | search reset

case with no target
target none
covers 1
$ search RAM 0
out 65
Error: No ROM loaded - this command needs an active debug target.
status 1
action none
end
